{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-42"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-talk-403815094-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"폐허가 된 은하계의 옛 성에서 고대 흡혈 괴수를 마주쳤다. 뜨거운 숨결이 내는 소리가 당신의 얼굴을 스쳤다…","talkId":403815094,"textHash":"6760064832795811494","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/talk-403815094","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a10fc1dc032a8704","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-talk-403815095-line"],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-talk-403815095-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그 순간, 괴수들이 갑자기 변화를 일으켰다. 괴수의 피부는 단단한 순금에 둘러싸였고, 녀석은 변이로 인해 고통스러워했다","talkId":403815095,"textHash":"18221763378098783025","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/talk-403815095","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a10fc1dc032a8704","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-talk-403815096-line"],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-talk-403815096-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"괴수의 축 처진 두 눈을 마주했다. 녀석은 수염을 위아래로 흔들었고, 그 뒤로는 녀석이 지키고 있는 새끼들이 보였다…","talkId":403815096,"textHash":"3517474075152535391","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/talk-403815096","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a10fc1dc032a8704","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-text-2483463023742346426-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"성년 괴수를 위해 「배웅」한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2483463023742346426","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/text-2483463023742346426","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0cf9b6105941ded9","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-text-9080352049063226838-effect"],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-text-9080352049063226838-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"다른 행성에 방법이 있을지도…","talkId":null,"textHash":"9080352049063226838","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/text-9080352049063226838","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0cf9b6105941ded9","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9967","bwikiMission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","bwikiReplyToIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-text-2483463023742346426-choice"]},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-42-text-2208667844337841296-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","missionId":"event-rogue-42","mission":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","scene":"짐승 떼•탐식의 재앙","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"전투 진입, 승리 시 ★2 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2208667844337841296","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:42/text-2208667844337841296","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"89e4a870c82cc2a5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"兽群•贪饕灾厄","bwikiRevision":58252,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-pa